# A ROOM FALLS QUIET WHILE A MACHINE PASSES ITS DOOR (DoorHush, 21_doors):
# the machines outside are snapshot at the door and walked on along their
# rounds while the player is in, and while one is within its hearing of the
# door the room holds its breath: its sound beds go (the &"hush" group) and its
# lamps dip. tests/interior/test_door_hush walks it past; this is the pair.
#
#   tools/tour.sh tours/door-hush.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0
#
# 01 is a warren with nothing outside (`unhushed`). 02 is a sorter spawned by
# its door, outside. 03 is the same warren while it goes by on its round
# (`hushed`): the seep through the roof and any lamp dipped.
coast calm
near door:container_warren
await door 5
wait 0.6
press use 0.1
await inside:container_warren 20
wait 2.0
shot 01-the-warren-with-nothing-outside with inside:container_warren,unhushed
near door
await door 10
press use 0.1
await outside 30
wait 1.0
spawn sorter
wait 0.5
shot 02-a-sorter-at-the-door with mob:sorter
near door:container_warren
await door 5
wait 0.3
press use 0.1
await inside:container_warren 20
await hushed 6
wait 0.5
shot 03-the-warren-while-it-goes-by with inside:container_warren,hushed
